    narr:narration """The trajectory of [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has moved from a foundational product thesis toward a rigorous [sprint-based delivery evidence chain](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidenceChain). As of July 2026, the narrative is anchored in concrete operational milestones rather than abstract design goals. The team has [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_1) and identified the [Zephyr integration as a key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_3) for broader system adoption. This shift toward tangible output is further supported by [record-high velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_2), which the team now uses as a primary proxy for the successful implementation of the decision-capture framework.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_1> ;
